{%- comment -%}
  ONE product-card system for every Montibello product grid (home best
  sellers, HOP / UNDER / Luxlight range grids, category grids). The three
  card renderers keep their own markup but share these zone rules, so the
  vertical structure is identical everywhere:

    [image canvas] [eyebrow] [title zone] [description zone] [size pills]

  - canvas: same ratio for every card, white, products shown whole
    (object-fit: contain, bottom-aligned) and never stretched
  - eyebrow 12/12 tracked caps; title 23/21 bold with a reserved two-line
    zone; description 16/19.7 with a reserved two-line zone
  - the card is a flex column and the pills have `margin-top: auto`, so
    cards in one row stretch to the same height and every pill row sits on
    the same baseline however long the title / description are
  - a single size is one compact pill aligned left (never full width); two
    sizes are two equal pills
  Measured from hair.montibello.com (248x346 canvas, 12px eyebrow, 23/21/700
  name, 16/19.7 excerpt, 29px pills).
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
/* theme blocks are wrapped in `.shopify-block`; make the wrapper stretch so
   the card inside fills the grid row and its pills can sit on the row baseline */
html body .shopify-block:has(> .montibello-product-range__card),
html body .shopify-block:has(> .montibello-product-teaser-card),
html body .shopify-block:has(> .montibello-category-grid__card) {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

html body .shopify-block > .montibello-product-range__card.montibello-product-range__card,
html body .shopify-block > .montibello-product-teaser-card.montibello-product-teaser-card,
html body .shopify-block > .montibello-category-grid__card.montibello-category-grid__card {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card.montibello-product-teaser-card,
html body .montibello-product-range__card.montibello-product-range__card,
html body .montibello-category-grid__card.montibello-category-grid__card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-self: stretch;
  color: #000;
  gap: 0;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__media.montibello-product-teaser-card__media,
html body .montibello-product-range__image-wrap.montibello-product-range__image-wrap,
html body .montibello-category-grid__media.montibello-category-grid__media {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: #fff;
  padding: 0;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__image.montibello-product-teaser-card__image,
html body .montibello-product-range__image.montibello-product-range__image,
html body .montibello-category-grid__image.montibello-category-grid__image {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: contain;
  object-position: center bottom;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__eyebrow.montibello-product-teaser-card__eyebrow,
html body .montibello-product-range__eyebrow.montibello-product-range__eyebrow,
html body .montibello-category-grid__eyebrow.montibello-category-grid__eyebrow {
  margin: 20px 0 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.11em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__name.montibello-product-teaser-card__name,
html body .montibello-product-range__name.montibello-product-range__name,
html body .montibello-category-grid__name.montibello-category-grid__name {
  margin: 10px 0 0;
  min-height: 42px;
  font-size: 23px;
  line-height: 21px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #000;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__subtitle.montibello-product-teaser-card__subtitle,
html body .montibello-product-range__type.montibello-product-range__type,
html body .montibello-category-grid__subtitle.montibello-category-grid__subtitle {
  margin: 10px 0 0;
  min-height: 39.4px;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 19.7px;
  font-weight: 500;
  opacity: 1;
  color: #000;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__pills.montibello-product-teaser-card__pills,
html body .montibello-product-range__pills.montibello-product-range__pills,
html body .montibello-category-grid__pills.montibello-category-grid__pills {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  margin: auto 0 0;
  padding-top: 12px;
}

html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__pill.montibello-product-teaser-card__pill,
html body .montibello-product-range__pill.montibello-product-range__pill,
html body .montibello-category-grid__pill.montibello-category-grid__pill {
  flex: 0 1 calc(50% - 3px);
  min-width: max-content;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 0 8px;
  border: 0.5px solid #767676;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: #fff;
  font-size: 13.6px;
  line-height: 28px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-align: center;
  color: #000;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
html body .montibello-product-teaser-card__pill.montibello-product-teaser-card__pill,
html body .montibello-product-range__pill.montibello-product-range__pill,
html body .montibello-category-grid__pill.montibello-category-grid__pill {
    flex: 0 1 calc(50% - 3px);
    min-width: max-content;
  }
}
</style>
